/// \fn ModuleData *SiegeDockingBehaviorModuleData::friend_newModuleData(INI *ini)
/// \brief Data factory registered for "SiegeDockingBehavior": creates the
///        module data and parses the module's INI block into it.
///
/// ModuleFactory::newModuleDataFromINI calls it through the registration
/// for each module line naming the module. The frame is the shared one
/// (see the group page). The constructor it calls is a store-only one that
/// sets the shared module-data virtual table and zeroes \c DUMMY, the
/// data's one field. The data factories of LockWeaponCreateModuleData and
