/// copy of identical code (identical-code folding) is the likely reason;
/// it does not make the three data classes related. The parse step uses
/// SiegeDockingBehaviorModuleData::buildFieldParse, whose table holds only
/// \c DUMMY. Where the reconstruction places this function and that
/// constructor is recorded in the project's function ledger, not here.
